{"v":4,"catch":"捍衛人類於紅色星球——生存、戰鬥，並在火星浩劫中勝出！","desc":"人類的生存之戰已經延伸到火星。\n在 Mission: Mars，你是人類殖民地最後的防線。手持可自訂的武器、炸藥與生存裝備，你必須迎戰一波波來勢洶洶的敵對生物，阻止牠們毀滅人類。\n\n佈置地雷、引爆毀滅性的爆炸，並在火星的險惡地貌中奮戰。每一波進攻都將考驗你的技巧——你能否撐到最後，守護人類的未來？\n\n憑藉快節奏的第一人稱射擊、震撼的爆破玩法，以及充滿科幻氛圍的體驗，Mission: Mars 將帶來緊張刺激的生存戰役。","publisher":"Eclipse Interactive","release":"2025-11-06","genres":["射擊","動作","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.3GB / Switch 1.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/47e5021256d36143dc1f3584346e458c1f76fb33209ba63e6a03a585bc19bc7f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/885a7fccae29790d8708f79f1d4aa487426c37a57d36123a67908f6e0ccf9fb7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/91abc6cd3b0107dacc0edb37de7ef62759125737f744ba55d6c8b60a89a97d4f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/101b84cabe3ed9eb6a2bd7ab8ee3afd39046fe24fad3ed62f4eaae30d2984dc3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bc6663bb17d6a7db0924f825285335ca23d5c1e657dcac86bc49f804667b991c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/efc2ca9d546d2c6067ce22d69b32d526d6781649806b46c06fe5942f707a6cf2.jpg"],"titleId":"010026e020612000","dlc":[]}